# Trend

Purpose: direction over time — is activity rising, dying, or seasonal.
Exists because point-in-time numbers can't distinguish "healthy and
stable" from "flatlining"; only the curve can.

| Option | Category | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| size / position | layout | x,y,w,h (default 6x3) | |
| chart | layout | area / bars | |
| title | display | text | |
| icon | display | icon name / none | |
| bucket | data | day / week | |
| since | data | 7d / 30d / 90d | |
| delta header | display | off / vs prior period | "+18%" verdict |
| total | display | on / off | header count |
| axis labels | display | on / minimal | |
| eventTypes | filter | event type[] (default all) | created/updated/... |
| concept | filter | conceptId / inherit | |
| actor | filter | any / member (proposed) | per-person trend |
